  "title": "What a triple is",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "What a triple is"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "text": "A triple is three things said in one breath: a subject, a predicate and an object. Everything else in this corpus is built from that one shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "lang": "turtle",
      "text": "@prefix ex: <http://example.invalid/> .\nex:ada ex:wrote ex:notes .\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "The **subject** is what is being talked about.",
        "The **predicate** is what is being said about it.",
        "The **object** is what it is being said about."
      ]
    }
  ],
